# Hides the entire e2e/ directory from file watchers that use the `ignore`
# crate (cargo-watch, dx serve, ripgrep, fd, etc). This file is NOT read by
# git, so files here remain tracked and committable.
#
# Purpose: prevent Playwright test files, node_modules, and test-result
# artifacts from triggering backend (`cargo watch`) and frontend (`dx serve`)
# rebuilds during local E2E work.
*
